{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/logo_img.png?t=1753247450\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce your way to victory in <strong>Elasticritters!</strong>, the dynamic, fast-paced <strong>precision platformer</strong> that will challenge your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat. Enter a vibrant world where adorable, squishy critters have learnt to navigate by bouncing due to their rotund nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/img1.png?t=1753247450\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1753247450\" /></div>Embark on a journey through <strong>over 100 unique stages</strong>, each filled with exhilarating jumps and daring stunts. Master the balance between precision and speed to achieve the quickest times. Face challenges of varying difficulty, all featuring distinctive obstacles and stunning, stylish visuals that make every moment pop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from more than <strong>8 adorably chubby critters</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <strong>hidden unlockables and secrets</strong> as you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn top ranks with the intricate <strong>performance-based ranking system</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your skills with the\u00a0<strong>super-charged boost bounce!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Groove to the cute and catchy <strong>8-bit style soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/img2.png?t=1753247450\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1753247450\" /></div>Navigate perilous situations and master challenging obstacles using the power of boost bounces. Conquer a series of intricate, mind-bending stages that will put your reflexes and adaptability to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/img3.png?t=1753247450\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1753247450\" /></div>Engage in epic local multiplayer face-offs across a range of exciting modes, including the fast-paced <i>Race</i> and the strategic <i>Capture the Flag</i>. Prove your prowess and outwit your opponents in adrenaline-pumping, high-stakes showdowns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop into the fun and see if you have what it takes to master the art of the bounce!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923650?t=1753247450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/d9c492fc43fb43cc27995f5a86b7f4129294943f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753247450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/710cf4c35e5b83cf865d4a78b53fb58a7fd76669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753247450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse