li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from more than <strong>8 adorably chubby critters</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <strong>hidden unlockables and secrets</strong> as you play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn top ranks with the intricate <strong>performance-based ranking system</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your skills with the\u00a0<strong>super-charged boost bounce!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Groove to the cute and catchy <strong>8-bit style soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/img2.png?t=1753247450\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1753247450\" /></div>Navigate perilous situations and master challenging obstacles using the power of boost bounces. Conquer a series of intricate, mind-bending stages that will put your reflexes and adaptability to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/img3.png?t=1753247450\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1753247450\" /></div>Engage in epic local multiplayer face-offs across a range of exciting modes, including the fast-paced <i>Race</i> and the strategic <i>Capture the Flag</i>. Prove your prowess and outwit your opponents in adrenaline-pumping, high-stakes showdowns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop into the fun and see if you have what it takes to master the art of the bounce!</strong></p>","developers":["Yooreekaa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923650/3d0f469ae9cc4f51946714722133d2a1c70568e9/header.jpg?t=1753247450","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Elasticritters! \u00a9 2023-2025 Yooreekaa Games, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257027641,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027641/movie480.mp4?t=1725510279","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027641/movie_max.mp4?t=1725510279"},"name":"Elasticritters! - Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257027641/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725510279","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027641/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1725510279","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027641/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1725510279"}}],"name":"Elasticritters!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 (or AMD Radeon R7 250)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound C